{"title":"背包问题 RELOAD","uid":"a47e5509a68fd10a960cec6ed904b43a","slug":"RE-Bag","date":"2022-09-08T02:55:11.000Z","updated":"2022-09-12T03:27:24.865Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/RE-Bag.json","keywords":"HerikoDeltana,HRiver2,","cover":"https://pic.imgdb.cn/item/63195b0316f2c2beb1d06052.jpg","content":"<p>「回顾自己快全忘掉的背包……」</p>\r\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\r\n<!-- toc -->\r\n<p>算是第一个 RELOAD 吧，主要是这两天真的忘了各种 DP，所以决定从 RELOAD\r\n背包开始，之前<a href=\"https://www.cnblogs.com/HRiver2/p/HR2note11.html\">在博客园写的</a>就不搬过来了。</p>\r\n<p>看着当年的博客，感觉自己也是长大了吧。</p>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p>夢の続きを知りたいのかい?</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<h2 id=\"背包\">01 背包</h2>\r\n<p>有 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>n</em></span>\r\n件物品，每件物品的价值为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>v</em><sub><em>i</em></sub></span>，费用为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>w</em><sub><em>i</em></sub></span>，背包容量为\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>m</em></span>，求问能放入背包的物品最大总价值。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"分析\">分析</h3>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p>因为是第一种背包，也是最为基础的一种，所以说的相对详细一点。</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p>01 背包的命名的含义在于：每一种物品都只有选和不选两个状态，即 01.</p>\r\n<p>用子问题来设计状态是一种常见的方式，在这里设 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>f</em>(<em>i</em>,<em>j</em>)</span> 表示前\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span>\r\n个物品<strong>恰好</strong>放入一个体积为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>j</em></span> 的背包可以获得的最大价值。</p>\r\n<p>然后考虑如何转移状态，首先，因为 01\r\n背包只有选和不选两个状态，所以考虑加入一个新的物品会对当前有什么影响：占据一部分背包容量，增加最大价值。</p>\r\n<p>那么显然如果要加入的物品费用小于剩余的背包容量，就可以向这个状态转移（当然，也可以不加入这个物品），即：</p>\r\n<p><span class=\"math display\"><em>f</em>(<em>i</em>,<em>j</em>) = max {<em>f</em>(<em>i</em>−1,<em>j</em>), <em>f</em>(<em>i</em>−1,<em>j</em>−<em>w</em><sub><em>i</em></sub>) + <em>c</em><sub><em>i</em></sub>}</span></p>\r\n<p>最终我们要的答案并不是 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>f</em>(<em>n</em>,<em>m</em>)</span>，而是 <span class=\"math inline\">max {<em>f</em>(<em>n</em>,0…<em>m</em>)}</span>，这是因为我们的状态设计时设置的为<strong>恰好</strong>，当然也可以通过在转移的时加入一项\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>f</em>(<em>i</em>,<em>j</em>−1)</span>\r\n来去掉这个恰好从而使得 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>f</em>(<em>n</em>,<em>m</em>)</span>\r\n是最终答案。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"优化\">优化</h3>\r\n<p>首先来看时间复杂度能不能优化。不过很可惜的是，在常规方法的 DP\r\n下，一般是不能优化的。</p>\r\n<p>那么来看空间优化。这里第 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span>\r\n项都是由 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em> − 1</span>\r\n转移来的，所以我们考虑能否在循环的过程中直接传递而非单独在数组中记录。</p>\r\n<p>注意上面的式子中，我们每次转移的时候第二维都是从更小的数值来的，所以我们只要倒序枚举\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>j</em></span>\r\n就可以保证转移的正确性，而根据我们的式子，枚举到当前物品的大小之后就没有意义了，所以我们可以优化成：</p>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb1\"><pre class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb1-1\"><a href=\"#cb1-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">);</span>i<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>n<span class=\"op\">;++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-2\"><a href=\"#cb1-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j<span class=\"op\">(</span>m<span class=\"op\">);</span>j<span class=\"op\">&gt;=</span>w<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];--</span>j<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-3\"><a href=\"#cb1-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">]=</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">],</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">-</span>w<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]]-</span>v<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n<p>而这个一维数组的实现方式是接下来其他背包的基础。</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"完全背包\">完全背包</h2>\r\n<p>有 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>n</em></span>\r\n种物品，每件物品都有无限件，每件价值为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>v</em><sub><em>i</em></sub></span>，费用为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>w</em><sub><em>i</em></sub></span>，背包容量为\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>m</em></span>，求问能放入背包的物品最大总价值。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"分析-1\">分析</h3>\r\n<p>不同于 01 背包的只有一点：每个物品有无数件。</p>\r\n<p>朴素的想法是做成无数个 01 背包，但是这样复杂度显然太高。</p>\r\n<p>有一个特殊的性质，考虑对于两件物品 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em>, <em>j</em></span>，若 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>c</em><sub><em>i</em></sub> &gt; <em>c</em><sub><em>j</em></sub></span>\r\n且 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>w</em><sub><em>i</em></sub> &lt; <em>w</em><sub><em>j</em></sub></span>，则可以把\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>j</em></span> 替换为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span>，但是这个性质并不能优化复杂度，还得寻求其他的方法。</p>\r\n<p>考虑和 01 背包的相关性，首先 01\r\n背包第二层循环逆序是为了保证转移的时候 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>f</em>(<em>i</em>−1,<em>j</em>−<em>w</em><sub><em>i</em></sub>)</span>\r\n已经被求过了，而在这里完全背包的特点是可以选无限多件，所以在考虑加入第\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span>\r\n件的时候，可能会需要一个已经选入第 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span> 种结果的子结果 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>f</em>(<em>i</em>,<em>j</em>−<em>w</em><sub><em>i</em></sub>)</span>，所以我们把\r\n01 背包中的第二层循环改为正向循环就能用相同的复杂度来解决完全背包。</p>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb2\"><pre class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb2-1\"><a href=\"#cb2-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">);</span>i<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>n<span class=\"op\">;++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-2\"><a href=\"#cb2-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j<span class=\"op\">(</span>w<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span>j<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>m<span class=\"op\">;--</span>j<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb2-3\"><a href=\"#cb2-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">]=</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">],</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">-</span>w<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]]-</span>v<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n<p>当然，还有一种思路，即把每个物品二进制拆分，因为不管选择几件第 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span> 种，都你能被 <span class=\"math inline\">2<sup><em>k</em></sup></span>\r\n表示出来，不过这样的话单个物品复杂度为 <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.033ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.419ex\" height=\"2.73ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 4163.1 1206.6\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D442\" d=\"M740 435Q740 320 676 213T511 42T304 -22Q207 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 704Q514 704 524 703Q621 689 680 617T740 435ZM637 476Q637 565 591 615T476 665Q396 665 322 605Q242 542 200 428T157 216Q157 126 200 73T314 19Q404 19 485 98T608 313Q637 408 637 476Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(763,0)\"><path data-c=\"28\" d=\"M94 250Q94 319 104 381T127 488T164 576T202 643T244 695T277 729T302 750H315H319Q333 750 333 741Q333 738 316 720T275 667T226 581T184 443T167 250T184 58T225 -81T274 -167T316 -220T333 -241Q333 -250 318 -250H315H302L274 -226Q180 -141 137 -14T94 250Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1152,0)\"><path data-c=\"6C\" d=\"M42 46H56Q95 46 103 60V68Q103 77 103 91T103 124T104 167T104 217T104 272T104 329Q104 366 104 407T104 482T104 542T103 586T103 603Q100 622 89 628T44 637H26V660Q26 683 28 683L38 684Q48 685 67 686T104 688Q121 689 141 690T171 693T182 694H185V379Q185 62 186 60Q190 52 198 49Q219 46 247 46H263V0H255L232 1Q209 2 183 2T145 3T107 3T57 1L34 0H26V46H42Z\"></path><path data-c=\"6F\" d=\"M28 214Q28 309 93 378T250 448Q340 448 405 380T471 215Q471 120 407 55T250 -10Q153 -10 91 57T28 214ZM250 30Q372 30 372 193V225V250Q372 272 371 288T364 326T348 362T317 390T268 410Q263 411 252 411Q222 411 195 399Q152 377 139 338T126 246V226Q126 130 145 91Q177 30 250 30Z\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"></path><path data-c=\"67\" d=\"M329 409Q373 453 429 453Q459 453 472 434T485 396Q485 382 476 371T449 360Q416 360 412 390Q410 404 415 411Q415 412 416 414V415Q388 412 363 393Q355 388 355 386Q355 385 359 381T368 369T379 351T388 325T392 292Q392 230 343 187T222 143Q172 143 123 171Q112 153 112 133Q112 98 138 81Q147 75 155 75T227 73Q311 72 335 67Q396 58 431 26Q470 -13 470 -72Q470 -139 392 -175Q332 -206 250 -206Q167 -206 107 -175Q29 -140 29 -75Q29 -39 50 -15T92 18L103 24Q67 55 67 108Q67 155 96 193Q52 237 52 292Q52 355 102 398T223 442Q274 442 318 416L329 409ZM299 343Q294 371 273 387T221 404Q192 404 171 388T145 343Q142 326 142 292Q142 248 149 227T179 192Q196 182 222 182Q244 182 260 189T283 207T294 227T299 242Q302 258 302 292T299 343ZM403 -75Q403 -50 389 -34T348 -11T299 -2T245 0H218Q151 0 138 -6Q118 -15 107 -34T95 -74Q95 -84 101 -97T122 -127T170 -155T250 -167Q319 -167 361 -139T403 -75Z\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2430,0)\"><path data-c=\"2061\" d=\"\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2596.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(278.3,394) scale(0.707)\"><path data-c=\"1D45A\" d=\"M21 287Q22 293 24 303T36 341T56 388T88 425T132 442T175 435T205 417T221 395T229 376L231 369Q231 367 232 367L243 378Q303 442 384 442Q401 442 415 440T441 433T460 423T475 411T485 398T493 385T497 373T500 364T502 357L510 367Q573 442 659 442Q713 442 746 415T780 336Q780 285 742 178T704 50Q705 36 709 31T724 26Q752 26 776 56T815 138Q818 149 821 151T837 153Q857 153 857 145Q857 144 853 130Q845 101 831 73T785 17T716 -10Q669 -10 648 17T627 73Q627 92 663 193T700 345Q700 404 656 404H651Q565 404 506 303L499 291L466 157Q433 26 428 16Q415 -11 385 -11Q372 -11 364 -4T353 8T350 18Q350 29 384 161L420 307Q423 322 423 345Q423 404 379 404H374Q288 404 229 303L222 291L189 157Q156 26 151 16Q138 -11 108 -11Q95 -11 87 -5T76 7T74 17Q74 30 112 181Q151 335 151 342Q154 357 154 369Q154 405 129 405Q107 405 92 377T69 316T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D464\" d=\"M580 385Q580 406 599 424T641 443Q659 443 674 425T690 368Q690 339 671 253Q656 197 644 161T609 80T554 12T482 -11Q438 -11 404 5T355 48Q354 47 352 44Q311 -11 252 -11Q226 -11 202 -5T155 14T118 53T104 116Q104 170 138 262T173 379Q173 380 173 381Q173 390 173 393T169 400T158 404H154Q131 404 112 385T82 344T65 302T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Q21 293 29 315T52 366T96 418T161 441Q204 441 227 416T250 358Q250 340 217 250T184 111Q184 65 205 46T258 26Q301 26 334 87L339 96V119Q339 122 339 128T340 136T341 143T342 152T345 165T348 182T354 206T362 238T373 281Q402 395 406 404Q419 431 449 431Q468 431 475 421T483 402Q483 389 454 274T422 142Q420 131 420 107V100Q420 85 423 71T442 42T487 26Q558 26 600 148Q609 171 620 213T632 273Q632 306 619 325T593 357T580 385Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(749,-150) scale(0.707)\"><path data-c=\"1D456\" d=\"M184 600Q184 624 203 642T247 661Q265 661 277 649T290 619Q290 596 270 577T226 557Q211 557 198 567T184 600ZM21 287Q21 295 30 318T54 369T98 420T158 442Q197 442 223 419T250 357Q250 340 236 301T196 196T154 83Q149 61 149 51Q149 26 166 26Q175 26 185 29T208 43T235 78T260 137Q263 149 265 151T282 153Q302 153 302 143Q302 135 293 112T268 61T223 11T161 -11Q129 -11 102 10T74 74Q74 91 79 106T122 220Q160 321 166 341T173 380Q173 404 156 404H154Q124 404 99 371T61 287Q60 286 59 284T58 281T56 279T53 278T49 278T41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Z\"></path></g></g><rect width=\"937.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3774.1,0)\"><path data-c=\"29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></span>，不如我们上面的 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>O</em>(<em>N</em><em>M</em>)</span> 做法。</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"多重背包\">多重背包</h2>\r\n<p>有 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>n</em></span> 种物品，每件物品有\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>a</em><sub><em>i</em></sub></span>\r\n件，每件价值为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>v</em><sub><em>i</em></sub></span>，费用为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>w</em><sub><em>i</em></sub></span>，背包容量为\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>m</em></span>，求问能放入背包的物品最大总价值。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"分析-2\">分析</h3>\r\n<p>最简单的想法是在 01\r\n背包的代码外层加入一个枚举数量的循环，不过这样复杂度同样比较高，仍然可以使用，不过需要单调队列。</p>\r\n<p>常见的写法是二进制拆分，就像上面完全背包的第二种方法。即：将第 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span>\r\n种物品分成若干件物品，其中每件物品有一个系数，这件物品的费用和价值均是原来的费用和价值乘以这个系数，这些系数为\r\n<span class=\"math inline\">1, 2, …, 2<sup><em>k</em> − 1</sup>, <em>a</em><sub><em>i</em></sub> − 2<sup><em>k</em></sup> + 1</span>，然后按照\r\n01 背包做即可。</p>\r\n<p>那么每种物品就被拆成了 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>O</em>(log)</span> 级别，总体复杂度为 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>O</em>(<em>M</em>∑log<em>a</em><sub><em>i</em></sub>).</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb3\"><pre class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb3-1\"><a href=\"#cb3-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i<span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span>i<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>n<span class=\"op\">;</span>i<span class=\"op\">++)</span> <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-2\"><a href=\"#cb3-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"dt\">int</span> t<span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">,</span>x<span class=\"op\">,</span>y<span class=\"op\">,</span>z<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-3\"><a href=\"#cb3-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        cin<span class=\"op\">&gt;&gt;</span>y<span class=\"op\">&gt;&gt;</span>x<span class=\"op\">&gt;&gt;</span>z<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-4\"><a href=\"#cb3-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-5\"><a href=\"#cb3-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">while</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>z<span class=\"op\">&gt;=</span>t<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-6\"><a href=\"#cb3-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            v<span class=\"op\">[++</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>x<span class=\"op\">*</span>t<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-7\"><a href=\"#cb3-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            c<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>y<span class=\"op\">*</span>t<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-8\"><a href=\"#cb3-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            z<span class=\"op\">-=</span>t<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-9\"><a href=\"#cb3-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            t<span class=\"op\">*=</span><span class=\"dv\">2</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-10\"><a href=\"#cb3-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"op\">}</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-11\"><a href=\"#cb3-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-12\"><a href=\"#cb3-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        v<span class=\"op\">[++</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>x<span class=\"op\">*</span>z<span class=\"op\">;</span>    </span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-13\"><a href=\"#cb3-13\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        c<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>y<span class=\"op\">*</span>z<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-14\"><a href=\"#cb3-14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">}</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-15\"><a href=\"#cb3-15\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-16\"><a href=\"#cb3-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i<span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span>i<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>n1<span class=\"op\">;</span>i<span class=\"op\">++)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-17\"><a href=\"#cb3-17\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j<span class=\"op\">=</span>m<span class=\"op\">;</span>j<span class=\"op\">&gt;=</span>v<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];</span>j<span class=\"op\">--)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb3-18\"><a href=\"#cb3-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">]=</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">],</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">-</span>v<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]]+</span>c<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n<h2 id=\"混合背包\">混合背包</h2>\r\n<p>简单而言就是以上三种背包都有，有些物品只有一件，有些有有限件数，有些则为无限件。</p>\r\n<p>直接分类讨论即可，因为多重背包在二进制拆分之后和 01\r\n背包是相同的，所以一起算就行。</p>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb4\"><pre class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb4-1\"><a href=\"#cb4-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i<span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span>i<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>n<span class=\"op\">;</span>i<span class=\"op\">++)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-2\"><a href=\"#cb4-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-3\"><a href=\"#cb4-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    ll x<span class=\"op\">,</span>y<span class=\"op\">,</span>z<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-4\"><a href=\"#cb4-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    scanf<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"st\">\"</span><span class=\"sc\">%lld</span><span class=\"st\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">%lld</span><span class=\"st\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">%lld</span><span class=\"st\">\"</span><span class=\"op\">,&amp;</span>x<span class=\"op\">,&amp;</span>y<span class=\"op\">,&amp;</span>z<span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-5\"><a href=\"#cb4-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-6\"><a href=\"#cb4-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">if</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>z<span class=\"op\">==</span><span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-7\"><a href=\"#cb4-7\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        v<span class=\"op\">[++</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>x<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-8\"><a href=\"#cb4-8\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        c<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>y<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-9\"><a href=\"#cb4-9\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        p<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span><span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-10\"><a href=\"#cb4-10\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">}</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-11\"><a href=\"#cb4-11\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">else</span> <span class=\"cf\">if</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>z<span class=\"op\">==</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-12\"><a href=\"#cb4-12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        v<span class=\"op\">[++</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>x<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-13\"><a href=\"#cb4-13\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        c<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>y<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-14\"><a href=\"#cb4-14\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        p<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-15\"><a href=\"#cb4-15\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">}</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-16\"><a href=\"#cb4-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">else</span> <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-17\"><a href=\"#cb4-17\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"dt\">int</span> t<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-18\"><a href=\"#cb4-18\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-19\"><a href=\"#cb4-19\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">while</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>z<span class=\"op\">&gt;=</span>t<span class=\"op\">)</span> <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-20\"><a href=\"#cb4-20\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            v<span class=\"op\">[++</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>x<span class=\"op\">*</span>t<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-21\"><a href=\"#cb4-21\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            c<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>y<span class=\"op\">*</span>t<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-22\"><a href=\"#cb4-22\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            p<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-23\"><a href=\"#cb4-23\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            z<span class=\"op\">-=</span>t<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-24\"><a href=\"#cb4-24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            t<span class=\"op\">*=</span><span class=\"dv\">2</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-25\"><a href=\"#cb4-25\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"op\">}</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-26\"><a href=\"#cb4-26\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-27\"><a href=\"#cb4-27\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        v<span class=\"op\">[++</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>x<span class=\"op\">*</span>z<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-28\"><a href=\"#cb4-28\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        c<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span>y<span class=\"op\">*</span>z<span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-29\"><a href=\"#cb4-29\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        p<span class=\"op\">[</span>n1<span class=\"op\">]=</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-30\"><a href=\"#cb4-30\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">}</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-31\"><a href=\"#cb4-31\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"op\">}</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-32\"><a href=\"#cb4-32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-33\"><a href=\"#cb4-33\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i<span class=\"op\">=</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">;</span>i<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>n1<span class=\"op\">;</span>i<span class=\"op\">++)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-34\"><a href=\"#cb4-34\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">if</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>p<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]==</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-35\"><a href=\"#cb4-35\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j<span class=\"op\">=</span>m<span class=\"op\">;</span>j<span class=\"op\">&gt;=</span>v<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];</span>j<span class=\"op\">--)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-36\"><a href=\"#cb4-36\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">]=</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">],</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">-</span>v<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]]+</span>c<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-37\"><a href=\"#cb4-37\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">else</span> <span class=\"cf\">if</span><span class=\"op\">(</span>p<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]==</span><span class=\"dv\">0</span><span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-38\"><a href=\"#cb4-38\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        <span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j<span class=\"op\">=</span>v<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">];</span>j<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>m<span class=\"op\">;</span>j<span class=\"op\">++)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb4-39\"><a href=\"#cb4-39\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>            f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">]=</span>max<span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">],</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>j<span class=\"op\">-</span>v<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]]+</span>c<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">]);</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n<h2 id=\"bitset-优化\">bitset 优化</h2>\r\n<p>之所以单独说一下这个优化，主要是前段时间脑子比较欠抽一直写错。</p>\r\n<p>众所周知 <code>bitset</code> 是一个长一点的 <span class=\"math inline\">01</span> 串，而它相关的操作往往常数会除掉一个 <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"12.782ex\" height=\"1.692ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -666 5649.6 748\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D464\" d=\"M580 385Q580 406 599 424T641 443Q659 443 674 425T690 368Q690 339 671 253Q656 197 644 161T609 80T554 12T482 -11Q438 -11 404 5T355 48Q354 47 352 44Q311 -11 252 -11Q226 -11 202 -5T155 14T118 53T104 116Q104 170 138 262T173 379Q173 380 173 381Q173 390 173 393T169 400T158 404H154Q131 404 112 385T82 344T65 302T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Q21 293 29 315T52 366T96 418T161 441Q204 441 227 416T250 358Q250 340 217 250T184 111Q184 65 205 46T258 26Q301 26 334 87L339 96V119Q339 122 339 128T340 136T341 143T342 152T345 165T348 182T354 206T362 238T373 281Q402 395 406 404Q419 431 449 431Q468 431 475 421T483 402Q483 389 454 274T422 142Q420 131 420 107V100Q420 85 423 71T442 42T487 26Q558 26 600 148Q609 171 620 213T632 273Q632 306 619 325T593 357T580 385Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(993.8,0)\"><path data-c=\"3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2049.6,0)\"><path data-c=\"33\" d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q293 21 321 74Q338 107 338 175V195Q338 290 274 322Q259 328 213 329L171 330L168 332Q166 335 166 348Q166 366 174 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\"></path><path data-c=\"32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" transform=\"translate(3049.6,0)\"><path data-c=\"A0\" d=\"\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3299.6,0)\"><path data-c=\"1D698\" d=\"M52 216Q52 318 118 379T261 440Q343 440 407 378T472 216Q472 121 410 58T262 -6Q176 -6 114 58T52 216ZM388 225Q388 281 351 322T261 364Q213 364 175 325T136 225Q136 158 174 114T262 70T350 114T388 225Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3824.6,0)\"><path data-c=\"1D69B\" d=\"M327 76Q359 76 369 70T380 38Q380 10 359 1H47Q24 8 24 38Q24 54 28 61T47 76H145V355H96L47 356Q24 363 24 393Q24 409 28 416T47 431H207Q223 419 226 414T229 393V387V369Q297 437 394 437Q436 437 461 417T487 368Q487 347 473 332T438 317Q428 317 420 320T407 327T398 337T393 347T390 356L388 361Q348 356 324 345Q228 299 228 170Q228 161 228 151T229 138V76H293H327Z\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" transform=\"translate(4349.6,0)\"><path data-c=\"A0\" d=\"\"></path></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4599.6,0)\"><path data-c=\"1D7FC\" d=\"M357 536Q357 546 318 546Q258 546 205 497T133 357V353L144 361Q210 402 285 402Q362 402 414 350Q479 285 479 193Q479 111 418 50T263 -11Q234 -11 207 -3T149 26T97 81T60 171T45 301Q45 444 129 533T319 622Q388 622 421 589T454 510Q454 491 442 475T402 458Q373 458 362 475T350 510Q350 520 354 528L357 536ZM319 326T269 326T179 298T136 223Q136 202 143 174T176 112T237 68Q246 66 265 66Q319 66 360 107Q395 146 395 197Q395 250 356 289Q319 326 269 326Z\"></path><path data-c=\"1D7FA\" d=\"M235 1Q213 10 213 32V38V46Q213 65 230 73Q236 76 274 76H314V168H183L52 169Q37 175 33 182T29 205V218L30 244Q53 283 155 443T264 613Q276 623 298 623H323H363Q378 616 385 601V244H429H450Q474 244 484 237T495 206Q495 179 477 171Q471 168 429 168H385V76H425H442Q466 76 476 69T487 38Q487 10 465 1H235ZM314 244V554L117 245L215 244H314Z\" transform=\"translate(525,0)\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></span>，在背包里主要的用处是用来优化复杂度，把一个\r\n<code>bitset</code> 作为一个状态，第 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span> 位为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span> 则说明 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span> 可以被表示出来（即可以达到 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>i</em></span> 的价值），而一般插入一个新值只需要\r\n<code>f|=(f&lt;&lt;x)</code> 就能实现，假设正常转移是 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>O</em>(<em>n</em><sup>2</sup>)</span> 的，使用了\r\n<code>bitset</code> 的复杂度就应该是 <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.798ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.14ex\" height=\"3.024ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -983.7 2714 1336.5\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><path data-c=\"1D442\" d=\"M740 435Q740 320 676 213T511 42T304 -22Q207 -22 138 35T51 201Q50 209 50 244Q50 346 98 438T227 601Q351 704 476 7