690 339 671 253Q656 197 644 161T609 80T554 12T482 -11Q438 -11 404 5T355 48Q354 47 352 44Q311 -11 252 -11Q226 -11 202 -5T155 14T118 53T104 116Q104 170 138 262T173 379Q173 380 173 381Q173 390 173 393T169 400T158 404H154Q131 404 112 385T82 344T65 302T57 280Q55 278 41 278H27Q21 284 21 287Q21 293 29 315T52 366T96 418T161 441Q204 441 227 416T250 358Q250 340 217 250T184 111Q184 65 205 46T258 26Q301 26 334 87L339 96V119Q339 122 339 128T340 136T341 143T342 152T345 165T348 182T354 206T362 238T373 281Q402 395 406 404Q419 431 449 431Q468 431 475 421T483 402Q483 389 454 274T422 142Q420 131 420 107V100Q420 85 423 71T442 42T487 26Q558 26 600 148Q609 171 620 213T632 273Q632 306 619 325T593 357T580 385Z\"></path></g><rect width=\"933\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2325,0)\"><path data-c=\"29\" d=\"M60 749L64 750Q69 750 74 750H86L114 726Q208 641 251 514T294 250Q294 182 284 119T261 12T224 -76T186 -143T145 -194T113 -227T90 -246Q87 -249 86 -250H74Q66 -250 63 -250T58 -247T55 -238Q56 -237 66 -225Q221 -64 221 250T66 725Q56 737 55 738Q55 746 60 749Z\"></path></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></span>（当然这样写应该不是很严谨）</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"润\">润</h2>\r\n<p>写完了，润！</p>\r\n<p><del>其实泛化、分组、依赖背包没写，但是懒得写了</del></p>\r\n","text":"「回顾自己快全忘掉的背包……」...","permalink":"/post/RE-Bag","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"3.4k","symbolsTime":"3 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"OI-Algorithm","slug":"OI-Algorithm","count":13,"path":"api/categories/OI-Algorithm.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"OI","slug":"OI","count":34,"path":"api/tags/OI.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E8%83%8C%E5%8C%85\"><span class=\"toc-text\">01 背包</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90\"><span class=\"toc-text\">分析</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96\"><span class=\"toc-text\">优化</span><